      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file poll_transcription.py, I need to write Python code that integrates with a concrete external provider for transcription services. I will choose AWS Transcribe as the provider, as it is a well-known service for transcription tasks. The code will include the necessary imports and API calls to poll the transcription job and return the transcript. </thinking>\n",
